le=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)~2024.08.23.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">공기업반</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: 2024.08.26.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)~2024.08.28.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">세부 프로그램</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">프로그램 안내에 영역별 확인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">으로 운영하오니 각각 신청하여야 함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">!! </span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">대기업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">공기업반 중복신청가능</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">교육방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">온라인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(ZOOM) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">비대면 교육 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">신청자에게 별도 입장주소 안내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">모집인원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: 150</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">명</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">교육비</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">전액무료</span></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">신청기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">: 2024.08.05.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 